{
  "id": "MAT.17",
  "number": "17",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 17",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghwayamwa oormeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata eawooji lah ghwaat Yesu Betaro ea Yakobo ea orjeeda ghaamwat siguura Yohana, ak goodeayi uhuuda giijeeda heeda geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwayamwa oormeadaanyi aba madeanyaawa, ghameang'meang' gheamamdaanyi ea gawuurji aseeta, nea gaweeriidi hang'weakaaschi ea ghawaar weeshinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwardu Musa ea Eliya, ak gabalool sea niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Betaro Yesu, “Ng'utamiida aamiy gideaba aseasa gajeepiidana hiji; iigasayi gaydasin aba hiji udahabeaschooji samwagu, akaleala daang'u gil nea niirja gaba Musa, nea niirja gaba Eliya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damani duu gabaloolean deagheata ghwahidu shamooghooda eesh ak gwadukuta, ak ghwanyaasha ghuuta jeeda shamooghooda nea gwayi, “Nih Orjeedeanyu aabwariinyi ahoosanani, ooleeysiina iit niny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy giinealanga ng'asheesu goobeedeayi ak ghabwada jeesinga ng'eanyi, nea ghabeal muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa Yesu ak ghawaas aba geatindaanyi nea gwayeesha, “Ang'eatng'eada, nea adoabeali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gatgat gheanyanga nyaawa, ea mwadaaha sih geaghus Yesu nea gaba geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwararang'aana giijeeda, gwayeesha Yesu, “Adiidu goorukusi eara sih iiteaba ng'asheesu oadaayiin ea eaghus ea niduuna Orjeeda Siida jeeda miyeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoanyaash giinealanga, “Anda gwayi ng'oorshoodiga geaghus ghanyi goosheeda ghwaan Eliya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha nea gwayeesha, “Eliya gaygoosheeda ghwaan, ak gwasisin haleanjeeda sean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geayeeshiineegwa, Eliya nigeawiit ghwaan ak ea meanala, ak geesima haleanjeeda sean gasa saawa. Gwasunu eara Orjeeda Siida gaygawa ak gajeesawan aba geatinga nyaawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwanal giinealanga gideaba gabaloola ng'asheega Yohaneeda Abaatiisachi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoahaap orjeeda bearji meangeenda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahita heeda eemeeda, gawa Siyagi headaanyi, ak gwatkuy aba madeadaanyi ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'utamiida, eaniyean bwayda orjeedeanyu, aba gideaba goohiili, nea iissa gwasawana muuchi; niny iimiisean gang'adeesa jeeda beasta, ghana galanya jeeda beega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu geayeadu heeda giinealangaagu ak ghwaraay ghoahaap.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Ea seaygeeda mandeawana masaweega biissa ea roodeadi, gajeendeaydooscheena ea ghoah eeju? Agooga gaydamilikiidaneegwa ea ghoah eeju? Ayeani heedeanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojuursa Yesu niny, ak gwariteaysa meangeenda, ak ghahaap orjeeda aba geeshangiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghoahuudaada giinealanga ea gaweay heeda Yesu, ak gwayeesha, “Anda aseasa gearaanyi eeruuta?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu, “Gwasin gheashooyda masaweegeagwa. Geayeeshiineegwa aba huumwa, inyeeda goondeawi masaweega deena ghajiileanda haradaali, gajoamuusa ayeeshiina giijeeni, ‘Loadadawana hiji ak guwi hoowa,’ ak gaygawa, ak ghanyi ea manda ng'asheanda hang'waay majoamuusa sinooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nea meang'nyeanji bea eendean ea moamu gwarita geaghus aba mooshta ASEETA ea giiluuldeaydeaba geat.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gabiikta gabaloola ng'asheega miyeadaanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda mideayeewa sean aba Galilaya gwayeesha Yesu saawa, “Orjeeda Siida gaygawa ak geayiin geatinga buuneeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygwanuus, ama eaweeteaba samwagu gaygwaduudu.” Hean gagiisan giinealanga muuchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giidaydeayda gwaadeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hita Gapernaumu, gaweay heeda Betaro fuga ang'oonyi gwaadeeda mwahita shekeeli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shekeeli: Lapiyeeda gwaadi jea gwasin gadiyeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ak gwayeesha, “Heapi! Giinealshoocheandeang'wa goodayiida gwaadi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha, “Ea goodayiida.” Iidu nea nihita ghoah, goosheeda Yesu ghoanyaash niny nea gwayeesha, “Simon, iing'ulayi ang'iing'i gawuurjiin? Sugoodiga muunda ng'eanyiida goong'oonyi gujaweeda ghana gwaadi aba hichpa ana fih? Aba heeda orjooga nyaawa ghana hichpa fih suuk?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eesha, “Hichpa fih suuk.” Gwayeesha Yesu niny, “Asi iisunu abeeda gaygoobal geat orjooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama abeeda iimajeanyareasa, guwi jeeda basooda ak giibuuti sidageeda ghwarja ghaang' siing'oonya ghweayeega ak gigeanu ghweayeanda madeeda jea eang'waay ak gijaadi ghuuta, ak gaynyasana shekeeli; gigeanu ak giidawi heedeanyu ea headaang'u.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
